{"parse": {"title": "RGS-14", "pageid": 146439, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/RGS-13\" title=\"RGS-13\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">RGS-14</span><a href=\"/wiki/RGS-15\" title=\"RGS-15\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">RGS</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">14</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E7.A6.BB.E4.B9.A1.E9.82.A3.E4.B8.80.E6.97.A5\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"离乡那一日\">离乡那一日</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 离乡那一日</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">A Second Departure</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span class=\"color-value\"></span>我<span class=\"color-value\"></span>决<span class=\"color-value\"></span>心<span class=\"color-value\"></span>抛<span class=\"color-value\"></span>下<span class=\"color-value\"></span>最<span class=\"color-value\"></span>重<span class=\"color-value\"></span>要<span class=\"color-value\"></span>的<span class=\"color-value\"></span>东<span class=\"color-value\"></span>西<span class=\"color-value\"></span>。<span class=\"color-value\"></span></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 3910114</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_9_bg_11.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_9_bg_11\"><img alt=\"3_9_bg_11\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1e/Cg-3_9_bg_11.png/600px-Cg-3_9_bg_11.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1e/Cg-3_9_bg_11.png/900px-Cg-3_9_bg_11.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1e/Cg-3_9_bg_11.png/1200px-Cg-3_9_bg_11.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>提丰死了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>它巨大的身体融进了遥远的岩浆里——像一锅小火慢炖的菜肴，冒出些许气泡。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"653213.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a9/HeadIconSmall-653213.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-653213.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"653213.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a9/HeadIconSmall-653213.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-653213.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a9/HeadIconSmall-653213.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-653213.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">荷米斯：</div><div>它的眼睛——！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>赫多涅一箭射了出去，洞穿其身体，放缓了那庞大之物的下沉速度。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>但它仍在下沉。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">赫多涅：</div><div>仪式的终点是取得提丰之眼……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">赫多涅：</div><div>它死了，但它仍在阻止我们。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302511.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-302511.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302511.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302511.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-302511.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302511.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-302511.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302511.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>啊！纳西索斯……！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一阵微弱的风掠过，它甚至不比蒸腾的热气更有力。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>闪过的身影并不算矫健，踉踉跄跄，却无比坚定地跑向沸腾的岩浆。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>有人想要阻止她别再向前跑，却被领袖以眼神止住。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"315615.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/74/HeadIconSmall-315615.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-315615.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"315615.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/74/HeadIconSmall-315615.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-315615.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/74/HeadIconSmall-315615.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-315615.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">赫多涅：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"655501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/59/HeadIconSmall-655501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-655501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"655501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/59/HeadIconSmall-655501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-655501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/59/HeadIconSmall-655501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-655501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>纳西索斯……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"655501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/59/HeadIconSmall-655501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-655501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"655501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/59/HeadIconSmall-655501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-655501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/59/HeadIconSmall-655501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-655501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>她想完成仪式的最后一环。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">纳西索斯：</div><div>呼……呼……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">纳西索斯：</div><div>好烫……好烫！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她奔跑着，时不时被滚烫的岩层烫得跳起来。随即，她扯断了颈上的项链，毫不犹豫，将她最珍贵的赐福扔进了岩浆之中</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>此时此刻，她忘记了追逐胜利。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">纳西索斯：</div><div>啊……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">纳西索斯：</div><div>原来它……是这个样子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">纳西索斯：</div><div>“它会变成一条只属于你的道路。”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">纳西索斯：</div><div>“通往任何你想抵达的地方，无论多远。”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">纳西索斯：</div><div>“届时，你只需要前进，便可抵达。”</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_9_bg_11.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_9_bg_11\"><img alt=\"3_9_bg_11\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1e/Cg-3_9_bg_11.png/600px-Cg-3_9_bg_11.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1e/Cg-3_9_bg_11.png/900px-Cg-3_9_bg_11.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1e/Cg-3_9_bg_11.png/1200px-Cg-3_9_bg_11.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>纳西索斯！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>好样的！！！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"653202.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/06/HeadIconSmall-653202.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-653202.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"653202.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/06/HeadIconSmall-653202.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-653202.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/06/HeadIconSmall-653202.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-653202.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">荷米斯：</div><div>纳西索斯——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"653202.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/06/HeadIconSmall-653202.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-653202.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"653202.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/06/HeadIconSmall-653202.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-653202.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/06/HeadIconSmall-653202.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-653202.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">荷米斯：</div><div>我们的英雄！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>众人的英雄抱着那最重要的仪式道具，跑回她的伙伴身边。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她回望身后，那条道路如同谢幕一般，渐渐隐去了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">纳西索斯：</div><div>神谕……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">纳西索斯：</div><div>……它指的就是这个吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">纳西索斯：</div><div>我会获得岛外的赐福，与我遇到的英雄们一起，击败最可怕的敌人……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">纳西索斯：</div><div>我一直以为……以为那个敌人就是赫多涅。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她踌躇起来，与怀中那只眼球对视。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">赫多涅：</div><div>哈哈哈哈！纳西索斯，这未尝不可！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">赫多涅：</div><div>我何尝不能是你的敌人？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>“最可怕的敌人”拍了拍宁芙的肩膀，遭受冲击的人在她的力道下趔趄。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">纳西索斯：</div><div>啊——！！！阿波罗——！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>宁芙如梦方醒，发出一声尖叫。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"653101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7e/HeadIconSmall-653101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-653101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"653101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7e/HeadIconSmall-653101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-653101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7e/HeadIconSmall-653101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-653101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿波罗：</div><div>纳西索斯殿下……我早就和您说过了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"653101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7e/HeadIconSmall-653101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-653101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"653101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7e/HeadIconSmall-653101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-653101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7e/HeadIconSmall-653101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-653101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿波罗：</div><div>神谕有无数种解读，您确信的，只是其中一种。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"653101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7e/HeadIconSmall-653101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-653101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"653101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7e/HeadIconSmall-653101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-653101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7e/HeadIconSmall-653101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-653101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿波罗：</div><div>但这也是个好结局，不是吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>预言者微笑着，与众人一齐看向吞没那最可怕敌人的岩浆。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>提丰的身体完全融进了岩浆里，仿若从未来过。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">赫多涅：</div><div>它……不会再复活了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>千年的旅程已落下帷幕。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_9_bg_10.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_9_bg_10\"><img alt=\"3_9_bg_10\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/19/Cg-3_9_bg_10.png/600px-Cg-3_9_bg_10.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/19/Cg-3_9_bg_10.png/900px-Cg-3_9_bg_10.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/19/Cg-3_9_bg_10.png/1200px-Cg-3_9_bg_10.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>从火山深处返回高处，碧蓝的海与繁荣的岛屿在此处可尽数领略。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"315634.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/19/HeadIconSmall-315634.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-315634.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"315634.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/19/HeadIconSmall-315634.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-315634.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/19/HeadIconSmall-315634.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-315634.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">赫多涅：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>然而领袖在这里停住了脚步。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"655501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/59/HeadIconSmall-655501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-655501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"655501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/59/HeadIconSmall-655501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-655501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/59/HeadIconSmall-655501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-655501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>怎么了？赫多涅殿下。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>君主的神情是前所未有的平和。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">赫多涅：</div><div>只是觉得……似曾相识。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">赫多涅：</div><div>我上一次杀死提丰的时候，我的族人也如此迎接我。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">赫多涅：</div><div>只是——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她的目光转向此刻围绕在她身边的每一个人身上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">赫多涅：</div><div>那时，我决定踏上这片土地，和族人们一起开始新的生活。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">赫多涅：</div><div>现在……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">赫多涅：</div><div>我决定离开这里了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>火山岛的领袖轻声道出一个决定。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">纳西索斯：</div><div>什么？！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">纳西索斯：</div><div>赫、赫、赫多涅殿下……你要离开火山岛？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>宁芙惊讶得带上了尊称。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>然而，当她看到其他同伴脸上的神情，却发现他们十分平静，对领袖的决定没有太多的意外。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">赫多涅：</div><div>呵……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">赫多涅：</div><div>我因追随变化而离开希腊，征战提丰，与火山交易，沉睡，轮回……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">赫多涅：</div><div>是的，阿波罗，你没有说错，我放不下这片故土，因为它是我在冒险中胜利的证明。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">赫多涅：</div><div>它的存在永远代表着我这一生的抉择。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">赫多涅：</div><div>“永远追随变化，永远与变化交锋。”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>领袖转向了岛外来客。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">赫多涅：</div><div>现在——不，在许久之前，世界就发生了更为剧烈的变化。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">赫多涅：</div><div>岛外的“奔流”正在影响一切。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">赫多涅：</div><div>如果我不将自己的力量投入到抵抗这影响之中，它终有一天也会流经火山岛，彻底改变这里。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">赫多涅：</div><div>而我无法在这巨变中坐享安宁，就像我不想按照火山的意愿而活。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">赫多涅：</div><div>在这样的循环之中，就算我知道完整的仪式——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">赫多涅：</div><div>我也想按照自己的意愿去尝试，即使等待我的只有失败。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"653121.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-653121.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-653121.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"653121.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-653121.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-653121.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-653121.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-653121.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿波罗：</div><div>殿下……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">赫多涅：</div><div>阿波罗，你对预言的解读很好。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">赫多涅：</div><div>“收获我早已获得的东西”，不错。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她闭了闭眼睛，脸上有释然的神情，臂环在阳光下闪闪发光。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">赫多涅：</div><div>我收获了和我一样、不畏惧任何凶险与变化的朋友，他们可以守护这片土地，照顾好这里的一切。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">赫多涅：</div><div>而我将离开火山岛，即使我会失去“火山的力量”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">赫多涅：</div><div>我将再次成为自己，投身于无穷的变化之中，走上我一开始就选定的道路。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">赫多涅：</div><div>这就像我登上离乡的船那一日。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她声音笃定，脸上却有怀念的神情。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"655501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/59/HeadIconSmall-655501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-655501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"655501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/59/HeadIconSmall-655501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-655501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/59/HeadIconSmall-655501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-655501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>赫多涅殿下。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>作为一位崭新的朋友，理应在此刻响应她。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"655501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/59/HeadIconSmall-655501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-655501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"655501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/59/HeadIconSmall-655501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-655501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/59/HeadIconSmall-655501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-655501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>那——这一场比赛的结果该怎么算？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>闻言，火山岛的领袖轻笑了一声。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>赫多涅抓起她最可敬的对手的手腕，她力大无穷，几乎要将她提离地面。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">赫多涅：</div><div>我宣布！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">赫多涅：</div><div>此次火山岛水上运动会暨提丰之战的胜利——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">赫多涅：</div><div>属于赫多涅！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">纳西索斯：</div><div>啊——赫多涅你这个小气鬼……！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>忿忿不平的宁芙当场大声反抗起来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">赫多涅：</div><div>还有，纳西索斯！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">纳西索斯：</div><div>……赫多涅殿下！我立刻收回上一句话！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">赫多涅：</div><div>以及——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">赫多涅：</div><div>维尔汀和她的朋友们。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_9_bg_13.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_9_bg_13\"><img alt=\"3_9_bg_13\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/Cg-3_9_bg_13.png/600px-Cg-3_9_bg_13.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/Cg-3_9_bg_13.png/900px-Cg-3_9_bg_13.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/Cg-3_9_bg_13.png/1200px-Cg-3_9_bg_13.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_9_bg_02.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_9_bg_02\"><img alt=\"3_9_bg_02\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0a/Cg-3_9_bg_02.png/600px-Cg-3_9_bg_02.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0a/Cg-3_9_bg_02.png/900px-Cg-3_9_bg_02.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0a/Cg-3_9_bg_02.png/1200px-Cg-3_9_bg_02.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>伫立岛上千年，承载一段历史的壁画迎来新的注视。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>众人将目光投向上面的空白之处。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"315610.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-315610.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-315610.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"315610.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-315610.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-315610.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-315610.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-315610.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">赫多涅：</div><div>原本，我只是将取得的提丰之眼镶嵌在这里。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她回望身后那长长的壁画。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"315610.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-315610.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-315610.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"315610.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-315610.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-315610.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-315610.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-315610.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">赫多涅：</div><div>后来，我的族人才将发生的一切记录下来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>如今，被记录的人与记录者归于永恒的黑暗之中，唯有轮回者仰望他们共同的回忆。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她重新将他们的战利品——提丰之眼，嵌回壁画之中。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_9_bg_03.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_9_bg_03\"><img alt=\"3_9_bg_03\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/72/Cg-3_9_bg_03.png/600px-Cg-3_9_bg_03.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/72/Cg-3_9_bg_03.png/900px-Cg-3_9_bg_03.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/72/Cg-3_9_bg_03.png/1200px-Cg-3_9_bg_03.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">赫多涅：</div><div>所有的仪式已经重启，提丰或许不会再复活了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">赫多涅：</div><div>如果它卷土重来，我的挚友们也自会有对付它的方法。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">赫多涅：</div><div>他们不一定要像我，或者说——他们也找到了属于自己的、全新的道路。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">赫多涅：</div><div>维尔汀，谢谢你。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>领袖站在已经完整的壁画之前。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">赫多涅：</div><div>谢谢你，愿意与我征战。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"655501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/59/HeadIconSmall-655501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-655501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"655501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/59/HeadIconSmall-655501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-655501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/59/HeadIconSmall-655501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-655501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>赫多涅殿下，我们也为能够参与到这段旅程感到荣幸。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>是啊！至少对我来说，我玩得很尽兴～真是一场酣畅淋漓的度假！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">十四行诗：</div><div>原来这就是度假……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>第一助手捕捉到了此前一直处于模糊状态的词汇，认真地思考起来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>当然，只要把工作丢掉，叫上朋友，去一个让人开心的地方，就是一场度假！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">十四行诗：</div><div>我明白了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她面带笑意。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">十四行诗：</div><div>赫多涅殿下，感谢您给予我们这样一场度假。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">赫多涅：</div><div>哈哈，这就满足了？对于我来说，难得的乐趣就应当被千方百计延续！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">赫多涅：</div><div>所以，你们在岛上剩余的时间，抑或是未来的日子，都会有更多更好的东西等着你们。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "RGS-14"}}